            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d0f14' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Where they fly </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>( 99.2 % of flights stay in North America · 109 abroad (55 cities) · long-haul = coast to coast</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Top 40 routes from home airport to destination · click a city for details</run>
          </formatted-text>
