            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Data ends Jul 28, 2023.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> Most customers book about a week ahead (median 8 days; 96 % within 14 days), so only 224 trips (1.4 %) that start in August or later are in the data – booked months in advance.</run>
